From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:37:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Follow fontconfig's whole sans-serif family chain and give
 the patched launcher a BAIDUNETGO_PROFILE data directory instead of an
 XDG_CONFIG_HOME pointer, since the pointer also hid the user's fonts.conf and
 made the interface draw Droid Sans instead of the font they set.

